USER PROMPT: Find two or three promising narrative recombinations for a mid-budget original film. Use the database yourself: start broad, cite sample counts, and do not invent columns or vocabulary terms.

--- FunctionCall #1: run_query ---
SELECT
    archetype,
    countMerge(sample_count) AS n_roi,
    quantileMerge(0.5)(roi_median) AS roi_median,
    countMerge(interest_sample_count) AS n_interest,
    quantileMerge(0.5)(interest_pct_median) AS interest_median
FROM mv_archetype_performance
GROUP BY archetype
HAVING n_roi >= 8
ORDER BY roi_median DESC
LIMIT 5;
    [GUARDRAIL ok]

